{['Companies','Product types','Artisans'].includes(view)&&<><PageHeading title={view} description={view==='Companies'?'Keep ownership clear and company prefixes permanent.':view==='Product types'?'Reusable saree classifications, separate from individual pieces.':'Your workshop network, with live balances for every artisan.'} action={<button className="btn primary" disabled={!can('master')} onClick={()=>openForm('master',{kind:view==='Companies'?'companies':view==='Artisans'?'artisans':'products'})}><Plus size={16}/>Add {view==='Companies'?'company':view==='Artisans'?'artisan':'product type'}</button>}/>{view==='Artisans'&&<div className="summary-strip"><div><span>Active artisans</span><b>{d.artisans.filter((a:any)=>a.active).length}</b></div><div><span>Currently with artisans</span><b>{withArtisans.length} <small>pieces</small></b></div><div><span>Confirmed returns · all time</span><b>{d.transactions.filter((t:any)=>t.type==='RETURN'&&t.status==='CONFIRMED').reduce((n:number,t:any)=>n+JSON.parse(t.snapshot).length,0)} <small>pieces</small></b></div></div>}<section className="panel"><Table exportName={view} rows={view==='Companies'?d.companies:view==='Artisans'?d.artisans:d.products} columns={view==='Companies'?[{key:'name',label:'Company',render:(c:any)=><div className="movement-cell"><div className="square-avatar">{c.name[0]}</div><b>{c.name}</b></div>},{key:'ownership',label:'Ownership',render:(c:any)=><Badge value={c.ownership}/>},{key:'prefix',label:'Fixed prefix',render:(c:any)=><span className="mono prefix">{c.prefix}</span>},{key:'stock',label:'Current pieces',render:(c:any)=>d.pieces.filter((p:any)=>p.company_id===c.id&&p.holder!=='RETURNED_TO_SOURCE').length},{key:'active',label:'Status',render:(c:any)=><Badge value={c.active?'Active':'Archived'}/>},{key:'edit',label:'',render:(c:any)=><button className="text-btn" disabled={!can('master')} onClick={()=>openForm('master',{...c,kind:'companies'})}>Manage<ChevronRight size={14}/></button>}]:view==='Product types'?[{key:'name',label:'Product type'},{key:'material',label:'Material'},{key:'weave',label:'Weave'},{key:'color',label:'Color'},{key:'design',label:'Design'},{key:'active',label:'Status',render:(p:any)=><Badge value={p.active?'Active':'Archived'}/>},{key:'edit',label:'',render:(p:any)=><button className="text-btn" disabled={!can('master')} onClick={()=>openForm('master',{...p,kind:'products'})}>Manage<ChevronRight size={14}/></button>}]:[{key:'name',label:'Artisan',render:(a:any)=><div className="movement-cell"><div className="avatar violet">{a.name.split(' ').map((s:string)=>s[0]).join('')}</div><div className="cell-title">{a.name}</div></div>},{key:'contact',label:'Contact'},{key:'address',label:'Address',render:(a:any)=>a.address||'—'},{key:'work_type',label:'Work type',render:(a:any)=><div className="cell-title">{a.work_type||'—'}{a.work_type==='Others'&&a.work_description&&<small>{a.work_description}</small>}</div>},{key:'balance',label:'Outstanding now',render:(a:any)=><button className="balance-link" onClick={()=>go('Inventory',a.id)}>{withArtisans.filter((p:any)=>p.artisan_id===a.id).length} pieces<ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button>},{key:'records',label:'Records',render:(a:any)=><button className="text-btn" onClick={()=>openForm('artisanHistory',a)}>Details<ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button>},{key:'active',label:'Status',render:(a:any)=><Badge value={a.active?'Active':'Archived'}/>},{key:'edit',label:'',render:(a:any)=><button className="text-btn" disabled={!can('master')} onClick={()=>openForm('master',{...a,kind:'artisans'})}>Manage<ChevronRight size={14}/></button>}]}/></section></>}
{view==='Stock checks'&&<><PageHeading title="Stock checks" description="Freeze an expected snapshot, count physical stock, and investigate differences." action={<button className="btn primary" disabled={!can('check')} onClick={()=>openForm('check')}><Plus size={16}/>Start stock check</button>}/><div className="info-strip"><ShieldCheck size={17}/>Counting never changes inventory. Resolve physical mismatches through a separate, reasoned adjustment.</div><section className="panel"><Table rows={d.checks} columns={[{key:'name',label:'Check name'},{key:'scope',label:'Scope',render:(c:any)=>c.scope==='ALL'?'All stock':c.scope==='IN_HOUSE'?'In house':c.scope.startsWith('company:')?cname(c.scope.split(':')[1]):c.scope.startsWith('lot:')?lname(c.scope.split(':')[1]):aname(c.scope)},{key:'expected',label:'Expected',render:(c:any)=>JSON.parse(c.expected).length},{key:'seen',label:'Counted',render:(c:any)=>d.observations.filter((o:any)=>o.check_id===c.id&&o.result==='EXPECTED').length},{key:'created_at',label:'Started',render:(c:any)=>date(c.created_at,true)},{key:'status',label:'Status',render:(c:any)=><Badge value={c.status}/>}]} onRow={(c:any)=>openForm('stockDetail',c)} exportName="Stock checks"/></section></>}
{view==='Exceptions'&&<><PageHeading title="Exceptions & corrections" description="Keep uncertainty visible. Every resolution leaves a trace." action={<button className="btn primary" disabled={!can('exception')} onClick={()=>openForm('exception')}><Plus size={16}/>Record exception</button>}/><div className="tabs"><button className={filter==='ALL'?'selected':''} onClick={()=>setFilter('ALL')}>All exceptions<span>{d.exceptions.length}</span></button><button className={filter==='OPEN'?'selected':''} onClick={()=>setFilter('OPEN')}>Open<span>{exceptions.length}</span></button><button className={filter==='RESOLVED'?'selected':''} onClick={()=>setFilter('RESOLVED')}>Resolved</button></div><section className="panel"><Table rows={d.exceptions.filter((e:any)=>filter==='ALL'||e.status===filter)} columns={[{key:'title',label:'Exception',render:(e:any)=><div className="cell-title">{e.title}<small>{e.detail}</small></div>},{key:'actor',label:'Recorded by'},{key:'created_at',label:'Recorded',render:(e:any)=>date(e.created_at)},{key:'status',label:'Status',render:(e:any)=><Badge value={e.status}/>},{key:'resolution',label:'Resolution',render:(e:any)=>e.status==='OPEN'?<button className="text-btn" disabled={!can('exception')} onClick={()=>openForm('resolve',e)}>Resolve<ArrowRight size={14}/></button>:e.resolution||'Approved at receipt'}]} exportName="Exceptions"/></section><div className="info-strip"><RotateCcw size={17}/>Dispute and damage reasons appear in Returns and the Reports audit log. To reverse a handoff or return, open the transaction in Reports. For a custody correction, open the individual piece.</div></>}
